WEBVTT

00:01:35.620 --> 00:01:36.400
Rika?

00:01:39.400 --> 00:01:43.770
It looked like those girls were bothering you, Ikki.

00:01:44.050 --> 00:01:46.440
No, that's not true.

00:01:46.440 --> 00:01:47.610
<i>I've seen her before...</i>

00:01:48.630 --> 00:01:49.740
<i>somewhere...</i>

00:01:51.500 --> 00:01:57.280
I'm sorry. Because of us, she had to wait so long.

00:01:57.880 --> 00:01:59.750
Farewell.

00:02:08.140 --> 00:02:11.620
I'm really sorry to have made you wait so long.

00:02:13.670 --> 00:02:16.950
So, to make up for it, what do you wish for?

00:02:16.950 --> 00:02:19.440
Look into my eyes and tell me.

00:02:19.440 --> 00:02:21.700
What do you want me to do?

00:02:21.700 --> 00:02:24.020
I'll listen to any request.

00:02:25.870 --> 00:02:29.230
Hey, when we're looking at each other from this close,

00:02:29.230 --> 00:02:30.730
don't you feel anything?

00:02:47.970 --> 00:02:49.740
Well, that's okay.

00:02:49.740 --> 00:02:52.960
I don't expect it to work on you now.

00:02:55.170 --> 00:02:56.230
Let's go.

00:02:56.230 --> 00:02:57.550
How about a movie?

00:02:58.610 --> 00:02:59.680
I'll carry your purse.

00:03:04.000 --> 00:03:05.860
It sure is crowded.

00:03:06.980 --> 00:03:09.100
How are you holding up?

00:03:09.100 --> 00:03:10.110
I'm fine.

00:03:10.960 --> 00:03:12.630
<i>Why am I with Ikki?</i>

00:03:13.580 --> 00:03:15.770
You've been pretty quiet.

00:03:16.580 --> 00:03:18.620
You're a little different from usual, aren't you?

00:03:20.930 --> 00:03:22.080
<i>What should I do?</i>

00:03:23.180 --> 00:03:24.510
<i>What should I say?</i>

00:03:26.760 --> 00:03:29.450
Well, I'll go buy the tickets.

00:03:32.120 --> 00:03:35.470
So, you're not my husband?

00:03:36.400 --> 00:03:38.300
This is my first time meeting you...

00:03:38.880 --> 00:03:39.770
You're lying.

00:03:40.350 --> 00:03:42.330
There's no way that's true.

00:03:42.330 --> 00:03:44.060
But I...

00:03:44.940 --> 00:03:46.390
<i>It's strange. It's not like my memories are all mixed up.</i>

00:03:46.390 --> 00:03:49.350
I know I have a wife and kids. That much is true.

00:03:49.350 --> 00:03:50.630
But I was with you... and then...

00:03:50.630 --> 00:03:52.070
<i>Did I go back in time?</i>

00:03:52.070 --> 00:03:52.720
But I was with you... and then...

00:03:52.720 --> 00:03:54.840
<i>No, that can't be.</i>

00:03:54.840 --> 00:03:55.570
But I was with you... and then...

00:03:56.640 --> 00:03:57.780
Ikki...

00:04:00.450 --> 00:04:03.990
When I came to, I was somewhere completely different.

00:04:04.660 --> 00:04:09.750
And it was similar, yet somehow different from where I was before.

00:04:10.900 --> 00:04:11.710
It's the same.

00:04:12.380 --> 00:04:13.750
It can't be a dream!

00:04:14.450 --> 00:04:16.820
<i>Then, what...</i>

00:04:36.780 --> 00:04:38.490
Looks like everyone else is gone.

00:04:40.620 --> 00:04:43.490
I can finally see your face.

00:04:43.490 --> 00:04:46.040
I only seem to take you to places that are dark,

00:04:46.040 --> 00:04:49.480
and I was worried you thought I had ulterior motives.

00:04:50.750 --> 00:04:54.350
I'd like to face you without sunglasses,

00:04:54.350 --> 00:04:56.050
but if I frivolously take them off,

00:04:56.050 --> 00:04:58.670
I might stop traffic or something.

00:04:59.270 --> 00:05:03.320
There are only a few places where I don't have to worry about the people around me.

00:05:04.850 --> 00:05:06.260
I'm sorry.

00:05:06.260 --> 00:05:09.750
Because of my condition, I'm always inconveniencing you.

00:05:10.370 --> 00:05:14.310
Alas, it doesn't affect the one person I want it to.

00:05:14.940 --> 00:05:16.210
<i>Condition?</i>

00:05:17.310 --> 00:05:18.580
Excuse me!

00:05:19.450 --> 00:05:22.530
We're cleaning up, if you don't mind.

00:05:24.520 --> 00:05:26.490
That was a strange movie, wasn't it?

00:05:27.150 --> 00:05:29.570
Did you not enjoy it very much?

00:05:29.570 --> 00:05:31.320
Do you dislike that kind of film?

00:05:32.210 --> 00:05:34.100
I chose it without asking you.

00:05:35.690 --> 00:05:38.580
Would you have preferred a sweeter love story?

00:05:39.920 --> 00:05:40.550
No...

00:05:45.790 --> 00:05:47.010
Shall we go home?

00:05:47.410 --> 00:05:51.110
We both have work tomorrow morning.

00:05:51.110 --> 00:05:53.760
<i>I have work tomorrow, too?</i>

00:05:53.760 --> 00:05:57.220
<i>What should I do? I still don't know what's going on.</i>

00:05:58.010 --> 00:05:58.690
What's wrong?

00:05:59.490 --> 00:06:01.100
You look worried.

00:06:01.930 --> 00:06:03.380
Do you want to spend more time together?

00:06:04.980 --> 00:06:05.930
Just kidding.

00:06:06.650 --> 00:06:10.460
I didn't really expect you to answer that.

00:06:11.260 --> 00:06:13.260
<i>My work...</i>

00:06:13.260 --> 00:06:14.900
I know.

00:06:14.900 --> 00:06:18.150
To make up for being late this morning, I'll still grant you that wish.

00:06:19.430 --> 00:06:20.610
You haven't decided yet?

00:06:23.360 --> 00:06:27.760
U-Um... Can you take me to work tomorrow?

00:06:28.310 --> 00:06:29.950
Take you in the morning?

00:06:30.620 --> 00:06:32.310
Okay, sure.

00:06:33.060 --> 00:06:36.440
We start at the same time tomorrow anyway, so let's go together.

00:06:39.380 --> 00:06:40.610
But is something wrong?

00:06:41.950 --> 00:06:44.080
Wh-What?

00:06:44.080 --> 00:06:47.430
It's unusual to hear you say something like that.

00:06:48.370 --> 00:06:50.580
Do you want to be with me that badly?

00:06:51.690 --> 00:06:53.210
Um...

00:06:53.210 --> 00:06:57.180
Well, I'd be delighted to fulfill that wish.

00:07:01.810 --> 00:07:04.690
<i>What's my relationship with Ikki?</i>

00:07:05.090 --> 00:07:06.280
<i>Could we be...</i>

00:07:06.990 --> 00:07:10.100
<i>But then, what about everything that happened before yesterday?</i>

00:07:13.330 --> 00:07:15.520
<i>If only Orion were here...</i>

00:07:25.930 --> 00:07:28.960
<i>There's definitely something wrong with me.</i>

00:07:28.960 --> 00:07:31.560
<i>Hey, you. Wake up.</i>

00:07:32.260 --> 00:07:34.510
<i>Hey, wake up!</i>

00:07:39.250 --> 00:07:40.260
Orion?

00:07:40.260 --> 00:07:41.730
Thank goodness!

00:07:41.730 --> 00:07:43.970
You know who I am.

00:07:43.970 --> 00:07:46.490
I was finally able to appear before you.

00:07:46.490 --> 00:07:49.280
If you asked who I was,

00:07:49.280 --> 00:07:51.520
I don't know what I'd do.

00:07:52.190 --> 00:07:53.160
Am I dreaming?

00:07:53.160 --> 00:07:55.660
No, no. You're not dreaming.

00:07:55.660 --> 00:07:58.550
We don't have time to be talking about this.

00:07:58.550 --> 00:08:00.820
I managed to appear before you somehow,

00:08:00.820 --> 00:08:03.190
but we don't know how long this'll last.

00:08:04.210 --> 00:08:06.320
There's something I want to ask.

00:08:06.740 --> 00:08:08.310
Wait, wait.

00:08:08.310 --> 00:08:11.200
There's something that I need to tell you, too.

00:08:11.820 --> 00:08:15.340
Could you hear me out first?

00:08:16.000 --> 00:08:19.470
I think you've already noticed,

00:08:19.470 --> 00:08:24.020
but the current situation is pretty different from when we first met, right?

00:08:25.650 --> 00:08:30.050
The current world you're in might not be the same one you started in,

00:08:30.050 --> 00:08:33.080
but this might be the real world.

00:08:33.750 --> 00:08:39.050
You look like you're in a very unstable position right now.

00:08:39.050 --> 00:08:42.310
All of this happened because I bumped into you...

00:08:42.310 --> 00:08:43.890
So...

00:08:44.810 --> 00:08:47.440
I don't really understand what you're saying.

00:08:48.890 --> 00:08:51.820
I don't really know what I'm saying either.

00:08:52.130 --> 00:08:57.450
Was everything I thought I experienced up until now a dream?

00:08:57.870 --> 00:08:59.710
No, it wasn't a dream.

00:09:00.130 --> 00:09:01.620
Then what's going on?

00:09:02.390 --> 00:09:07.880
It's a little difficult to explain, but where you are now is really...

00:09:09.250 --> 00:09:10.130
Orion...

00:09:10.130 --> 00:09:11.260
Wait!

00:09:17.850 --> 00:09:18.890
<i>Ikki?</i>

00:09:19.730 --> 00:09:21.640
<i>Sorry for being late today.</i>

00:09:21.640 --> 00:09:23.880
<i>Let's go out again when we have time.</i>

00:09:23.880 --> 00:09:28.550
<i>You seemed a little out of it today.</i>

00:09:28.550 --> 00:09:30.340
<i>Are you feeling okay?</i>

00:09:30.340 --> 00:09:31.630
<i>I'm a little worried.</i>

00:09:32.350 --> 00:09:34.600
So he thought I was acting strange, after all.

00:09:38.450 --> 00:09:39.290
Who's this?

00:09:39.660 --> 00:09:42.280
My daily report for work?

00:09:44.870 --> 00:09:45.800
I can't.

00:09:47.670 --> 00:09:50.100
There's too much I don't understand.

00:10:04.010 --> 00:10:04.980
Yes?

00:10:05.410 --> 00:10:07.670
Good morning, I think?

00:10:07.670 --> 00:10:10.390
I'm already in front of your apartment.

00:10:10.390 --> 00:10:11.820
Are you ready to come out?

00:10:11.820 --> 00:10:13.280
Er, yeah!

00:10:16.690 --> 00:10:17.690
Sorry.

00:10:18.380 --> 00:10:20.710
Did I come a little too early?

00:10:20.710 --> 00:10:23.620
If I came on time, it might turn out like yesterday.

00:10:24.550 --> 00:10:27.410
I couldn't make you wait again.

00:10:28.230 --> 00:10:28.840
Here.

00:10:29.330 --> 00:10:30.670
Let me take your purse.

00:10:33.890 --> 00:10:35.010
Let's go.

00:10:37.870 --> 00:10:38.830
This is...

00:10:38.830 --> 00:10:39.920
Is something wrong?

00:10:39.920 --> 00:10:41.270
No, not really.

00:10:43.900 --> 00:10:45.480
Good morning.

00:10:45.480 --> 00:10:48.520
Hey, what are you wandering around for?

00:10:49.010 --> 00:10:52.990
Do I not tell you every time to line up before I get here?

00:10:52.990 --> 00:10:53.980
Yessir!

00:10:58.200 --> 00:11:02.450
Customers are the enemy! Customers are the enemy! Customers are the enemy!
I'm impressed you were able to be so friendly to Waka.

00:11:05.140 --> 00:11:06.710
<i>He's different again...</i>

00:11:09.060 --> 00:11:11.780
There's an order for the Maid's Handmade Parfait.

00:11:12.370 --> 00:11:13.410
Handmade?

00:11:15.300 --> 00:11:17.670
<i>Is the recipe the same?</i>

00:11:18.710 --> 00:11:19.820
Should I help you?

00:11:20.890 --> 00:11:22.390
No, it's...

00:11:22.390 --> 00:11:23.980
He'll get mad at you again.

00:11:24.990 --> 00:11:28.820
Okay, place the flakes into the glass,

00:11:28.820 --> 00:11:31.510
then fresh cream on top.

00:11:32.310 --> 00:11:36.790
Then arrange the fruit and add the ice cream,

00:11:37.460 --> 00:11:38.470
and it's done.

00:11:39.780 --> 00:11:41.060
<i>This is...</i>

00:11:42.850 --> 00:11:44.370
Thank you for waiting.

00:11:44.370 --> 00:11:45.380
Thank you.

00:11:47.310 --> 00:11:48.000
Um...

00:11:49.320 --> 00:11:50.380
I like you.

00:11:50.770 --> 00:11:52.630
Do you have a girlfriend?

00:11:53.000 --> 00:11:54.520
<i>Amazing.</i>

00:11:54.520 --> 00:11:56.760
<i>Just by locking eyes, she's...</i>

00:11:56.760 --> 00:11:59.300
<i>Ikki is really popular.</i>

00:12:03.600 --> 00:12:04.890
Ikki!

00:12:04.890 --> 00:12:06.100
We've been waiting!

00:12:06.100 --> 00:12:06.930
Was it a long day?

00:12:06.930 --> 00:12:08.780
Wait for me in the usual place.

00:12:10.590 --> 00:12:11.480
Um...

00:12:12.730 --> 00:12:17.490
<i>Where's the usual place?</i>

00:12:24.320 --> 00:12:25.140
Yes?

00:12:25.140 --> 00:12:26.270
Hello.

00:12:26.270 --> 00:12:27.380
Where are you?

00:12:28.070 --> 00:12:29.800
I'm already here.

00:12:29.800 --> 00:12:31.160
I'm sorry.

00:12:31.160 --> 00:12:34.170
I'm still at the back entrance to the store.

00:12:34.170 --> 00:12:35.510
What? Why?

00:12:35.840 --> 00:12:37.050
Um...

00:12:37.050 --> 00:12:38.900
I'm heading back now. Stay there.

00:12:39.630 --> 00:12:40.470
Okay.

00:12:45.210 --> 00:12:46.230
What's wrong?

00:12:46.230 --> 00:12:47.480
I'm sorry.

00:12:48.100 --> 00:12:52.650
You've been acting strange since yesterday.

00:12:53.560 --> 00:12:55.700
Is there something you're hiding from me?

00:12:57.020 --> 00:12:58.360
Yesterday,

00:12:58.360 --> 00:13:01.640
when you asked me to come pick you up,

00:13:01.640 --> 00:13:04.920
I was more happy than anything else, so I couldn't ask,

00:13:05.620 --> 00:13:08.430
but you wouldn't normally ask for that, would you?

00:13:10.050 --> 00:13:14.460
It's okay to rely on your boyfriend.

00:13:14.970 --> 00:13:17.960
<i>So Ikki is really</i>

00:13:18.410 --> 00:13:21.430
<i>my boyfriend?</i>

00:13:23.770 --> 00:13:27.640
<i>I don't have any memories of having spent time with him.</i>

00:13:27.640 --> 00:13:29.100
<i>I have no idea</i>

00:13:29.850 --> 00:13:31.260
<i>what's true anymore.</i>

00:13:32.230 --> 00:13:34.480
What's wrong? You're really quiet.

00:13:34.970 --> 00:13:37.210
Oh, it's nothing.

00:13:38.030 --> 00:13:38.930
Okay.

00:13:39.520 --> 00:13:40.610
Then let's go home.

00:13:41.100 --> 00:13:41.740
Here,

00:13:43.040 --> 00:13:44.340
I'll take your purse.

00:13:50.130 --> 00:13:51.120
We're here.

00:13:51.760 --> 00:13:53.790
Would you like me to return your purse?

00:13:55.080 --> 00:13:56.730
You want me to return it, right?

00:13:58.900 --> 00:14:00.530
Come here.

00:14:07.080 --> 00:14:09.890
You aren't gonna close your eyes?

00:14:12.620 --> 00:14:15.250
You're making it hard to kiss you.

00:14:15.250 --> 00:14:17.180
Are you resisting me?

00:14:17.180 --> 00:14:18.370
Ikki?

00:14:19.000 --> 00:14:21.480
I won't do it if you don't want me to,

00:14:21.480 --> 00:14:22.830
but do you really not want me to?

00:14:23.530 --> 00:14:29.690
Was I just being conceited to think that you had come to like me?

00:14:31.800 --> 00:14:33.730
Hey, close your eyes.

00:14:34.490 --> 00:14:35.950
I won't do anything scary.

00:14:38.750 --> 00:14:39.920
You still can't?

00:14:40.940 --> 00:14:44.420
This princess just won't fall for me.

00:14:45.360 --> 00:14:45.920
P—

00:14:45.920 --> 00:14:47.440
Please stop.

00:14:51.820 --> 00:14:54.420
I thought it'd work this time.

00:14:56.070 --> 00:14:58.530
This is the first time I've ever had to fight so hard.

00:14:58.530 --> 00:14:59.280
What?

00:15:00.070 --> 00:15:01.610
"What?"

00:15:01.610 --> 00:15:03.890
You're the one I'm fighting.

00:15:05.190 --> 00:15:10.370
You might be the first girl who hasn't fallen for me.

00:15:12.240 --> 00:15:13.650
Just kidding.

00:15:13.650 --> 00:15:14.760
That was a lie.

00:15:15.420 --> 00:15:18.690
I'll definitely capture your heart.

00:15:18.690 --> 00:15:22.520
I'll never admit defeat.

00:15:22.520 --> 00:15:23.540
Good night.

00:15:23.540 --> 00:15:24.540
Yes.

00:15:25.840 --> 00:15:27.750
One more month...

00:15:28.650 --> 00:15:30.290
Well, see you tomorrow at work.

00:15:30.750 --> 00:15:32.080
One month?

00:15:38.880 --> 00:15:39.910
Again?

00:15:44.220 --> 00:15:46.810
Hey there, Miss Maid.

00:15:50.060 --> 00:15:52.750
Sawa, you're a customer today?

00:15:52.750 --> 00:15:53.750
Huh?

00:15:53.750 --> 00:15:56.750
Well, what else would I be?

00:15:59.400 --> 00:16:02.200
<i>Is Sawa different, too?</i>

00:16:03.710 --> 00:16:07.030
You're so cute. Let's take a picture together next time.

00:16:11.320 --> 00:16:13.430
Do you have a minute later?

00:16:15.690 --> 00:16:17.710
I'm going to get right to the point.

00:16:17.710 --> 00:16:20.050
Do you know who your boyfriend really is?

00:16:21.000 --> 00:16:23.030
My boyfriend, Ikki?

00:16:23.030 --> 00:16:24.660
Who he really is?

00:16:24.660 --> 00:16:27.640
It looks like you haven't had a bad experience yet.

00:16:28.640 --> 00:16:32.020
Well, I checked for myself today,

00:16:32.020 --> 00:16:35.300
and I think that rumor might be true.

00:16:35.300 --> 00:16:36.690
Rumor?

00:16:37.250 --> 00:16:39.810
I thought you already knew.

00:16:39.810 --> 00:16:43.490
There's a rumor that he goes out with girls like it's a game.

00:16:44.810 --> 00:16:49.470
Then, three months later, he'll suddenly toss them aside.

00:16:50.990 --> 00:16:54.850
Anyway, I don't think he's someone you should fall in love with.

00:16:57.770 --> 00:17:00.480
It's none of my business though, right?

00:17:01.200 --> 00:17:03.620
You know best.

00:17:03.620 --> 00:17:05.470
But I was worried.

00:17:07.660 --> 00:17:09.280
I'll go, then.

00:17:09.280 --> 00:17:10.020
Okay.

00:17:11.290 --> 00:17:12.300
Um...

00:17:13.000 --> 00:17:13.940
Thank you.

00:17:17.920 --> 00:17:18.960
Hello there.

00:17:19.880 --> 00:17:23.550
Good morning.

00:17:23.550 --> 00:17:24.910
It's been a while.

00:17:25.360 --> 00:17:27.680
I was on vacation.

00:17:28.580 --> 00:17:30.450
Didn't I tell you?

00:17:31.760 --> 00:17:32.680
Yeah.

00:17:32.680 --> 00:17:37.140
Hey, you seem different.

00:17:37.140 --> 00:17:38.170
Do I?

00:17:38.550 --> 00:17:41.470
Did you break up with Ikki?

00:17:42.920 --> 00:17:45.650
I figured it was about time you two broke up.

00:17:45.650 --> 00:17:48.710
The question is, who's next?

00:17:49.640 --> 00:17:53.270
Would it be okay if I went for Ikki?

00:17:54.920 --> 00:17:57.000
I can't wait to see what happens.

00:18:00.990 --> 00:18:03.860
Ladies and gentlemen, good work today.

00:18:06.120 --> 00:18:07.120
<i>Huh?</i>

00:18:07.590 --> 00:18:08.620
<i>Ikki...</i>

00:18:09.250 --> 00:18:10.370
<i>and Kento...</i>

00:18:10.700 --> 00:18:12.660
Ken, I didn't think it'd be you.

00:18:13.210 --> 00:18:15.120
It's been a while, Ikkyu.

00:18:16.190 --> 00:18:18.000
<i>There's something weird about them...</i>

00:18:19.510 --> 00:18:20.440
...like before.

00:18:24.500 --> 00:18:26.090
Is that all right, Ikkyu?

00:18:26.090 --> 00:18:29.610
Your girlfriend isn't keeping up with our conversation.

00:18:29.610 --> 00:18:30.810
Sorry.

00:18:32.580 --> 00:18:34.090
<i>I was surprised.</i>

00:18:36.590 --> 00:18:39.650
So it's finally come to this.

00:18:39.940 --> 00:18:41.710
It's too bad.

00:18:41.710 --> 00:18:44.500
If you want to beg for mercy, now's your chance.

00:18:44.500 --> 00:18:49.870
I've created the ultimate weapon to finish you off.

00:18:51.440 --> 00:18:53.330
Can you defeat me?

00:18:53.330 --> 00:18:56.930
Farewells are always bittersweet, but this is the end.

00:18:56.930 --> 00:18:58.170
Take this!

00:18:59.630 --> 00:19:00.170
Come then!

00:19:00.830 --> 00:19:02.420
I'll take you down!

00:19:03.620 --> 00:19:04.940
Please stop!

00:19:12.350 --> 00:19:13.510
Sorry.

00:19:13.510 --> 00:19:16.160
I never expected you to jump in.

00:19:16.160 --> 00:19:18.520
You really fell spectacularly.

00:19:18.520 --> 00:19:19.900
Does it still hurt?

00:19:19.900 --> 00:19:21.070
I'm really sorry.

00:19:21.070 --> 00:19:23.690
No, it's much better.

00:19:24.100 --> 00:19:28.910
I thought I would enjoy a math puzzle with Ikkyu today, but...

00:19:29.270 --> 00:19:35.360
The truth is, I found one hard enough not to lose to the one you made.

00:19:35.360 --> 00:19:36.160
It's a duel.

00:19:36.730 --> 00:19:38.400
Just what I was hoping for.

00:19:38.400 --> 00:19:42.350
However, we've brought you along to Ikkyu's room, too.

00:19:43.490 --> 00:19:45.940
Judging from your behavior,

00:19:45.940 --> 00:19:48.680
is this your first time here?

00:19:51.520 --> 00:19:53.720
So he's been fighting that hard.

00:19:53.720 --> 00:19:55.250
I see.

00:19:55.250 --> 00:19:58.520
A girl that even Ikkyu can't conquer has appeared.

00:20:00.120 --> 00:20:02.200
Don't count me out just yet.

00:20:02.200 --> 00:20:03.900
There're still three more weeks.

00:20:06.940 --> 00:20:08.720
I'll go get some drinks.

00:20:15.440 --> 00:20:19.220
<i>Kento and Ikki are friends.</i>

00:20:19.220 --> 00:20:21.980
<i>Should I ask him about what Sawa told me?</i>

00:20:23.830 --> 00:20:26.770
Um, Ikki and I...

00:20:26.770 --> 00:20:27.710
What?

00:20:29.520 --> 00:20:35.600
Until now, Ikkyu has always broken up with his girlfriend after three months, for some reason.

00:20:37.910 --> 00:20:41.000
<i>So what Sawa said was true.</i>

00:20:41.000 --> 00:20:46.130
But I can say that you are different from the rest.

00:20:47.590 --> 00:20:48.740
Thanks for waiting.

00:20:49.150 --> 00:20:50.240
Solved it.

00:20:50.240 --> 00:20:51.800
What? Already?

00:20:51.800 --> 00:20:53.780
I was hoping for something more difficult.

00:20:53.780 --> 00:20:56.150
I didn't stand a chance against you, Ken.

00:20:56.800 --> 00:20:58.280
Is coffee all right?

00:20:58.280 --> 00:21:01.050
You're a coffee addict as usual.

00:21:01.050 --> 00:21:02.170
That's right.

00:21:07.930 --> 00:21:10.170
<i>Why three months?</i>

00:21:12.060 --> 00:21:15.050
Well, I should be heading home.

00:21:15.420 --> 00:21:17.350
Thank you for the puzzle.

00:21:17.350 --> 00:21:18.580
I'll try it.

00:21:18.580 --> 00:21:20.430
Please do.

00:21:20.430 --> 00:21:24.700
I'll think of a good penalty for when you give up.

00:21:26.560 --> 00:21:28.230
I'll walk you home.

00:21:30.230 --> 00:21:31.250
See you.

00:21:42.890 --> 00:21:44.460
You're not staying over?

00:21:47.690 --> 00:21:48.600
I...

00:21:49.860 --> 00:21:50.960
Um...

00:23:26.800 --> 00:23:28.570
What kind of movies do you like?

00:23:28.570 --> 00:23:31.710
Explosive action flicks and heartwarming love stories are nice,

00:23:31.710 --> 00:23:38.560
but I like ones where a cute and smart fairy uses his brain and courageously helps a girl who's lost her memories.

00:23:38.560 --> 00:23:39.740
Just kidding!
